   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "M5 Smart Wearable Breast Pump | #1 Wearable Pump on Amazon | Under 48 dB Quiet Pumping | FSA & HSA Eligible | No Reaching Into Your Bra | Control It From Your Phone | Only 4 Parts To Clean | Patented DoubleFit Flange | Adjust It While Holding Baby | Free 1-On-1 IBCLC Session | World Breastfeeding Week | Upgraded with App Control | Hands-Free Pumping Freedom | Our Most-Bought Pump | 30 Days To Change Your Mind | FSA/HSA eligible. Free 1-on-1 IBCLC session, 30-day returns, 1-year warranty. | Just 8 oz with 3 modes and 9 suction levels. Up to 6 sessions on one charge. | 3 modes, 9 levels & DoubleFit flange for a secure, comfy fit. Pump hands-free. | Shop M5 Smart Direct: Free IBCLC Support, 1-Year Warranty & 30-Day Returns",
